[gd_resource type="Theme" load_steps=17 format=3]

; Project Dawn's UI theme: dark wood and brass (chosen 2026-11-18 from a list
; of ten). Deep walnut fields, a brass band round every window, brass titles,
; candle-amber text. It is the project theme (project.godot, gui/theme/custom),
; so every Control inherits it; a window names a variation instead of building
; its own style box, and a label gets the body colour with no override at all.
; The palette lives here and in scripts/ui_theme.gd (UITheme) for the code
; that colours things at runtime; tools/check_ui_theme_lockstep.gd holds the
; two together. The style boxes are flat colour for now; wood-grain and brass
; nine-slice textures can replace them here without touching a script.

